      "init": {
        "label": "Tasks joined to their projects",
        "color": "amber",
        "collapsed": false,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 230,
        "body": "# Tasks joined to their projects\n\nEach task note names its projects as links, `[[Projects/Website launch]]`, and each project is a note of its own with a budget, a status and a due date. **Unnest** gives a task one row per project it names, **LINKNAME** reads the note each link points at, and **Join** matches that name to the Projects folder, so the open minutes sit beside the project's own properties.\n\nWith no vault folder set in Settings, the readers use the bundled sample vault.",
        "fieldTypes": {}
      }
    },
